.* QUIJRNRCV: WRKJRNRCV, the journal receivers a name selects. The first
.* entry is blank: option 1 there creates one.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=RCV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=RCVS VARS='OPT RCV RCVLIB RCVTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=RCVKEYS HELP='KEYS/RCVKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Repeat position to
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Position to
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKJRNRCV KEYL=RCVKEYS HELP=WRKJRNRCV ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Journal Receivers
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RCVS VIEWS=2 EXTACT=YES.(Cannot find object to match specified name.)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='RETURN 1' HELP='WRKJRNRCV/OPTIONS'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?DLTJRNRCV JRNRCV(&RCVLIB./&RCV.)' HELP='WRKJRNRCV/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DSPJRNRCVA JRNRCV(&RCVLIB./&RCV.)' HELP='WRKJRNRCV/OPTIONS'.5=Display attributes
:LISTACT OPTION=13 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CHGOBJD OBJ(&RCVLIB./&RCV.) OBJTYPE(*JRNRCV)' HELP='WRKJRNRCV/OPTIONS'.13=Change description
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKJRNRCV/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RCV USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/RCV'.Journal     Receiver
:LISTCOL VAR=RCVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/RCVLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=RCVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RCVTEXT'.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RCV RCVLIB RCVTEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT RCV RCVLIB'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 5 and 13 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKJRNRCV.Work with Journal Receivers - Help
:P.The journal receivers the name selects. Type an option next to one to
delete it, show its attributes or change its text; option 1 on the
blank first line creates one with the name typed there.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/RCVKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the receivers again.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line.
:PT.F11=Display names only
:PD.Shows the names alone, or the text again.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display.
:PT.F16=Repeat position to
:PD.Finds the next receiver the last position starts with.
:PT.F17=Position to
:PD.Asks for a name to position the list at.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKJRNRCV/OPTIONS'.Options
:PARML.
:PT.1=Create
:PD.Creates a journal receiver (CRTJRNRCV).
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Deletes the receiver (DLTJRNRCV).
:PT.5=Display attributes
:PD.Shows the receiver's attributes (DSPJRNRCVA).
:PT.13=Change description
:PD.Changes the receiver's text (CHGOBJD).
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKJRNRCV/OPT'.Opt
:P.Type the option to use on the receiver.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RCV'.Journal receiver
:P.The receiver's name.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RCVLIB'.Library
:P.The library it is in.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RCVTEXT'.Text
:P.The receiver's text description.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
